cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Commercial Trend Radar"
abstract: >-
  Data-driven, backtested watchlist of research concepts and cross-field
  fusions with commercialization potential, built from the arXiv corpus
  (AI, applied math, software, security/crypto, quant finance, quantum,
  chips). Emphasizes honest baselines: matched structural controls,
  permutation tests, bootstrap confidence intervals, fully reproducible
  pipeline.
